{"context_uuid":"f77b5923-1762-4b01-94a4-759d7a890272","context_title":"Replit klón","created_at":"2026-01-16T22:50:06.549502Z","updated_at":"2026-01-16T22:51:59.993572Z","mode":"COPILOT","collection_uuid":"acf198fe-17f4-4392-8432-2ade14634fe1","entries":[{"entry_uuid":"4357d40e-47db-4559-a607-8e9ea4e799d0","query":"Replit klón","answer":"Egy egyszer\u0171, statikus Replit\u2011szer\u0171 online IDE fel\u00fcletet kapsz lent, teljes \u00f6n\u00e1ll\u00f3 HTML f\u00e1jlk\u00e9nt, Tailwinddel \u00e9s a Replit s\u00f6t\u00e9t sz\u00ednpalett\u00e1j\u00e1hoz igaz\u00edtott sz\u00ednekkel.[1]\nA tipogr\u00e1fia is k\u00f6zel\u00edti az eredetit (IBM Plex Sans UI\u2011hoz, monospace editorhoz), de a m\u0171k\u00f6d\u00e9s (futtat\u00e1s, build) itt m\u00e9g nincs bek\u00f6tve.[1]\n\n## Mit tud ez a mini Replit?\n\n- S\u00f6t\u00e9t h\u00e1tt\u00e9r (#0F1017, #1A1C25, #23252F), hasonl\u00f3, mint a Replit alap dark t\u00e9m\u00e1ja.[1]\n- Fels\u0151 glob\u00e1lis *header* Replit\u2011szer\u0171 log\u00f3val, keres\u0151vel, \u201eRun / Share\u201d gombokkal.[1]\n- Bal oldali f\u00e1jlpanel projekt n\u00e9vvel, \u201eAdd file\u201d gombbal \u00e9s egyszer\u0171 f\u00e1fa\u2011makettel.  \n- K\u00f6z\u00e9ps\u0151 \u201eeditor\u201d panel tab s\u00e1vval \u00e9s monospace \u201ek\u00f3dsz\u00f6veggel\u201d, ami kin\u00e9zetre eml\u00e9keztet a Replit editorra.[1]\n- Jobb oldali konzol / shell panel tabokkal, monospace output blokkal.  \n- Container query: nagyobb sz\u00e9less\u00e9gn\u00e9l 3 oszlop, mobilon a konzol lecs\u00faszik alulra (oszlopos elrendez\u00e9s).  \n\n## Teljes HTML f\u00e1jl (Tailwind + CSS container query)\n\n```html\n<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"hu\" class=\"h-full\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <title>Replit kl\u00f3n \u2013 mini online IDE</title>\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n\n    <!-- Tailwind CDN (3.x, de a markup Tailwind 4-hez is kompatibilis utility szinten) -->\n    <script src=\"\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Google Fonts \u2013 Replithez hasonl\u00f3 fontk\u00e9szlet -->\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"\" crossorigin>\n    <link\n      href=\"\"\n      rel=\"stylesheet\"\n    >\n\n    <style>\n      :root {\n        /* Replit dark t\u00e9ma sz\u00edneihez k\u00f6zeli paletta */\n        --bg-root: #0f1017;\n        --bg-default: #1a1c25;\n        --bg-higher: #23252f;\n        --border-subtle: #31343f;\n        --border-strong: #3a3d48;\n        --accent-primary: #0079f2;\n        --accent-primary-soft: #004182;\n        --accent-primary-soft2: #0053a6;\n        --text-default: #e6e8ed;\n        --text-dim: #bfc4ca;\n        --text-dimmest: #a2a8b2;\n      }\n\n      html {\n        block-size: 100%;\n      }\n\n      body {\n        block-size: 100%;\n        margin: 0;\n        font-family: \"IBM Plex Sans\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont,\n          \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;\n        background-color: var(--bg-root);\n        color: var(--text-default);\n      }\n\n      /* Editor monospace */\n      .font-code {\n        font-family: \"JetBrains Mono\", ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo,\n          Monaco, Consolas, \"Liberation Mono\", \"Courier New\", monospace;\n      }\n\n      /* Container query setup a f\u0151 IDE shellre */\n      .ide-shell {\n        container-type: inline-size;\n        container-name: ide-shell;\n      }\n\n      /* Desktop: alap layout (h\u00e1rom oszlop) \u2013 a utility classok defini\u00e1lj\u00e1k */\n\n      /* Mobil / sz\u0171k n\u00e9zet: konzol lemegy alulra, file\u2011panel fel\u00fcl marad */\n      @container ide-shell (max-width: 1023px) {\n        .ide-shell {\n          flex-direction: column;\n        }\n\n        .ide-shell-aside-files {\n          inline-size: 100%;\n          block-size: auto;\n          border-inline-end: none;\n          border-block-end: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n        }\n\n        .ide-shell-editor {\n          inline-size: 100%;\n        }\n\n        .ide-shell-aside-console {\n          inline-size: 100%;\n          block-size: 40vh;\n          border-inline-start: none;\n          border-block-start: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n        }\n      }\n\n      /* N\u00e9h\u00e1ny finomhangol\u00f3 egyedi st\u00edlus logical propertykkel */\n      .tab-pill {\n        padding-inline: 0.5rem;\n        padding-block: 0.25rem;\n        border-radius: 999px;\n      }\n\n      .input-compact {\n        padding-inline: 0.5rem;\n        padding-block: 0.25rem;\n      }\n\n      .scroll-thin {\n        scrollbar-width: thin;\n      }\n\n      .scroll-thin::-webkit-scrollbar {\n        inline-size: 6px;\n      }\n\n      .scroll-thin::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\n        background: transparent;\n      }\n\n      .scroll-thin::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n        background: #31343f;\n        border-radius: 999px;\n      }\n\n      .scroll-thin::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {\n        background: #444752;\n      }\n    </style>\n  </head>\n  <body class=\"h-full\">\n    <div class=\"min-h-screen flex flex-col bg-[var(--bg-root)] text-[var(--text-default)]\">\n      <!-- Fels\u0151 glob\u00e1lis nav -->\n      <header\n        class=\"h-12 flex items-center justify-between bg-[var(--bg-default)] border-b border-[var(--border-subtle)] px-3\"\n      >\n        <!-- Bal: logo + project v\u00e1lt\u00f3 -->\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <div\n              class=\"inline-flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-[var(--accent-primary-soft)] text-xs font-semibold\"\n            >\n              \u25b6\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"text-sm font-semibold tracking-tight\">Replit kl\u00f3n</span>\n          </div>\n\n          <div\n            class=\"hidden md:inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md bg-[var(--bg-higher)] border border-[var(--border-subtle)] px-2 py-1 text-[0.7rem] text-[var(--text-dim)]\"\n          >\n            <span class=\"inline-block w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400\"></span>\n            <span>my-python-app</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- K\u00f6z\u00e9p: men\u00fc / tabok -->\n        <nav class=\"hidden lg:flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-[var(--text-dim)]\">\n          <button class=\"tab-pill bg-[var(--bg-higher)] text-[var(--text-default)]\">\n            Code\n          </button>\n          <button class=\"tab-pill hover:bg-[var(--bg-higher)]\">Console</button>\n          <button class=\"tab-pill hover:bg-[var(--bg-higher)]\">Output</button>\n          <button class=\"tab-pill hover:bg-[var(--bg-higher)]\">Packages</button>\n          <button class=\"tab-pill hover:bg-[var(--bg-higher)]\">Secrets</button>\n        </nav>\n\n        <!-- Jobb: keres\u0151 + gombok -->\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n          <div\n            class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md bg-[var(--bg-higher)] border border-[var(--border-subtle)] text-[0.75rem] text-[var(--text-dimmest)]\"\n          >\n            <svg\n              xmlns=\"\"\n              class=\"ms-2 size-3.5 opacity-70\"\n              viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\n              fill=\"none\"\n              stroke=\"currentColor\"\n              stroke-width=\"2\"\n            >\n              <circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"6\" />\n              <line x1=\"16\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"21\" />\n            </svg>\n            <input\n              class=\"bg-transparent border-none outline-none input-compact placeholder:text-[var(--text-dimmest)]\"\n              placeholder=\"Search files or commands\"\n              type=\"text\"\n            />\n          </div>\n\n          <button\n            class=\"hidden sm:inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md bg-[var(--accent-primary)] hover:bg-sky-500 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-white\"\n          >\n            <span class=\"inline-flex size-3.5 items-center justify-center rounded-[2px] bg-black/20\">\n              \u25b6\n            </span>\n            Run\n          </button>\n\n          <button\n            class=\"hidden sm:inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md bg-[var(--bg-higher)] hover:bg-slate-800 border border-[var(--border-subtle)] px-3 py-1.5 text-xs text-[var(--text-dim)]\"\n          >\n            Share\n          </button>\n\n          <button\n            class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[var(--bg-higher)] border border-[var(--border-subtle)] size-7 text-[0.7rem] font-medium\"\n          >\n            SY\n          </button>\n        </div>\n      </header>\n\n      <!-- F\u0151 IDE shell: file tree + editor + console -->\n      <main class=\"flex-1 flex overflow-hidden ide-shell\">\n        <!-- F\u00e1jl panel (bal) -->\n        <aside\n          class=\"ide-shell-aside-files w-60 shrink-0 bg-[var(--bg-root)] border-r border-[var(--border-subtle)] flex flex-col\"\n        >\n          <!-- Fels\u0151 s\u00e1v: projekt + akci\u00f3k -->\n          <div class=\"h-10 flex items-center justify-between px-3 border-b border-[var(--border-subtle)]\">\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col\">\n              <span class=\"text-[0.7rem] text-[var(--text-dimmest)] uppercase tracking-[0.08em]\">\n                Files\n              </span>\n              <span class=\"text-xs text-[var(--text-default)]\">my-python-app</span>\n            </div>\n            <button\n              class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-[var(--bg-higher)] hover:bg-slate-800 border border-[var(--border-subtle)] size-6 text-[0.7rem]\"\n              title=\"New file\"\n            >\n              +\n            </button>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- F\u00e1fa -->\n          <div class=\"flex-1 overflow-auto scroll-thin text-[0.8rem] py-2\">\n            <ul class=\"space-y-1 px-2\">\n              <li class=\"text-[var(--text-dimmest)] mb-1\">.</li>\n              <li class=\"flex items-center gap-1\">\n                <span class=\"inline-block size-3 text-xs\">\ud83d\udcc1</span>\n                <span class=\"text-[var(--text-dim)]\">.config</span>\n              </li>\n              <li class=\"flex items-center gap-1\">\n                <span class=\"inline-block size-3 text-xs\">\ud83d\udcc1</span>\n                <span class=\"text-[var(--text-dim)]\">venv</span>\n              </li>\n              <li class=\"flex items-center gap-1\">\n                <span class=\"inline-block size-3 text-xs\">\ud83d\udcc4</span>\n                <span class=\"text-[var(--text-default)]\">main.py</span>\n              </li>\n              <li class=\"flex items-center gap-1\">\n                <span class=\"inline-block size-3 text-xs opacity-70\">\ud83d\udcc4</span>\n                <span class=\"text-[var(--text-dim)]\">requirements.txt</span>\n              </li>\n              <li class=\"flex items-center gap-1\">\n                <span class=\"inline-block size-3 text-xs opacity-70\">\ud83d\udcc4</span>\n                <span class=\"text-[var(--text-dim)]\">README.md</span>\n              </li>\n\n              <li class=\"mt-2 text-[0.7rem] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-[var(--text-dimmest)]\">\n                Tools\n              </li>\n              <li class=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-[var(--text-dim)]\">\n                <span class=\"inline-block size-3 text-xs\">\u2699\ufe0f</span>\n                <span>Packages</span>\n              </li>\n              <li class=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-[var(--text-dim)]\">\n                <span class=\"inline-block size-3 text-xs\">\ud83d\udd11</span>\n                <span>Secrets</span>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n        </aside>\n\n        <!-- Editor k\u00f6z\u00e9p panel -->\n        <section class=\"ide-shell-editor flex-1 flex flex-col bg-[var(--bg-default)]\">\n          <!-- Tab bar -->\n          <div\n            class=\"h-9 flex items-end bg-[var(--bg-higher)] border-b border-[var(--border-subtle)] px-2 gap-1 text-[0.75rem]\"\n          >\n            <button\n              class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 border-t border-x border-[var(--border-strong)] border-b-0 rounded-t-md bg-[var(--bg-default)] px-2 py-1\"\n            >\n              <span class=\"inline-block size-3 text-[0.7rem]\">\ud83d\udc0d</span>\n              <span>main.py</span>\n            </button>\n            <button\n              class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-t-md px-2 py-1 text-[var(--text-dim)] hover:bg-slate-800/60\"\n            >\n              <span>README.md</span>\n            </button>\n            <button\n              class=\"ms-auto inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md px-2 py-1 text-[var(--text-dimmest)] hover:bg-slate-800/60\"\n            >\n              <span>\u22ef</span>\n            </button>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Editor tartalom -->\n          <div class=\"flex-1 relative overflow-hidden bg-[var(--bg-root)]\">\n            <!-- Sor sz\u00e1m + k\u00f3d (statikus, demo) -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex\">\n              <!-- Gutter -->\n              <div\n                class=\"w-10 shrink-0 border-r border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--bg-root)]/95 text-[0.7rem] text-[var(--text-dimmest)] pt-2 px-1 font-code leading-relaxed select-none\"\n              >\n                <div>1</div>\n                <div>2</div>\n                <div>3</div>\n                <div>4</div>\n                <div>5</div>\n                <div>6</div>\n                <div>7</div>\n                <div>8</div>\n                <div>9</div>\n                <div>10</div>\n              </div>\n\n              <!-- K\u00f3d blokk -->\n              <div\n                class=\"flex-1 overflow-auto scroll-thin font-code text-[0.8rem] leading-relaxed text-slate-100/90 pt-2 ps-3 pe-4\"\n              >\n                <pre class=\"whitespace-pre\">\n<span class=\"text-emerald-400\"># Egyszer\u0171 Replit-szer\u0171 editor demo</span>\n<span class=\"text-fuchsia-400\">from</span> <span class=\"text-sky-300\">fastapi</span> <span class=\"text-fuchsia-400\">import</span> FastAPI\n<span class=\"text-fuchsia-400\">from</span> <span class=\"text-sky-300\">pydantic</span> <span class=\"text-fuchsia-400\">import</span> BaseModel\n\napp <span class=\"text-fuchsia-400\">=</span> FastAPI()\n\n\n<span class=\"text-fuchsia-400\">class</span> <span class=\"text-amber-300\">Message</span>(BaseModel):\n    text: <span class=\"text-sky-300\">str</span>\n\n\n<span class=\"text-emerald-400\">@app.get</span>(<span class=\"text-lime-300\">\"/\"</span>)\n<span class=\"text-fuchsia-400\">async def</span> <span class=\"text-amber-300\">root</span>():\n    <span class=\"text-fuchsia-400\">return</span> {<span class=\"text-lime-300\">\"hello\"</span>: <span class=\"text-lime-300\">\"Replit kl\u00f3nb\u00f3l \ud83d\udc4b\"</span>}\n\n\n<span class=\"text-emerald-400\">@app.post</span>(<span class=\"text-lime-300\">\"/echo\"</span>)\n<span class=\"text-fuchsia-400\">async def</span> <span class=\"text-amber-300\">echo</span>(payload: Message):\n    <span class=\"text-fuchsia-400\">return</span> {<span class=\"text-lime-300\">\"you_said\"</span>: payload.text}\n                </pre>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Als\u00f3 status bar -->\n          <footer\n            class=\"h-7 flex items-center justify-between bg-[var(--bg-root)] border-t border-[var(--border-subtle)] px-3 text-[0.7rem] text-[var(--text-dimmest)]\"\n          >\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n              <span>Spaces: 4</span>\n              <span>UTF\u20118</span>\n              <span>LF</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n              <span>Python 3.11</span>\n              <span>Ln 4, Col 11</span>\n            </div>\n          </footer>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Jobb oldali konzol / output -->\n        <aside\n          class=\"ide-shell-aside-console w-80 shrink-0 bg-[var(--bg-root)] border-l border-[var(--border-subtle)] flex flex-col\"\n        >\n          <!-- Tab bar a konzolhoz -->\n          <div\n            class=\"h-9 flex items-center gap-1 px-2 border-b border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--bg-default)] text-[0.75rem]\"\n          >\n            <button\n              class=\"tab-pill bg-[var(--bg-higher)] text-[var(--text-default)]\"\n            >\n              Console\n            </button>\n            <button class=\"tab-pill hover:bg-[var(--bg-higher)] text-[var(--text-dim)]\">\n              Shell\n            </button>\n            <button class=\"tab-pill hover:bg-[var(--bg-higher)] text-[var(--text-dim)]\">\n              Output\n            </button>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Konzol tartalom -->\n          <div class=\"flex-1 overflow-auto scroll-thin font-code text-[0.75rem] bg-[var(--bg-root)] px-3 py-2\">\n            <div class=\"text-emerald-400\">\n              \u25b6 Running <span class=\"text-slate-200\">python main.py</span>...\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mt-1 text-slate-100\">\n              Uvicorn running on <span class=\"text-sky-300\"></span> (Press CTRL+C to quit)\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mt-2 text-slate-200\">\n              GET <span class=\"text-sky-300\">/</span> <span class=\"text-emerald-400\">200 OK</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mt-2 text-slate-200\">\n              POST <span class=\"text-sky-300\">/echo</span> <span class=\"text-emerald-400\">200 OK</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mt-3 text-slate-400\">\n              &gt;&gt;&gt; <span class=\"text-slate-200\"># Ide j\u00f6hetne egy interakt\u00edv REPL...</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Konzol alja: mini input / st\u00e1tusz -->\n          <div\n            class=\"h-8 flex items-center justify-between bg-[var(--bg-default)] border-t border-[var(--border-subtle)] px-2 text-[0.7rem] text-[var(--text-dimmest)]\"\n          >\n            <span>Console ready</span>\n            <span class=\"hidden sm:inline\">CPU 3% \u2022 RAM 120 MB</span>\n          </div>\n        </aside>\n      </main>\n    </div>\n  </body>\n</html>\n```\n\n## Hogyan tov\u00e1bb \u00e9p\u00edthet\u0151?\n\n- Ha val\u00f3di szerkeszt\u0151t akarsz, cser\u00e9ld a statikus `<pre>` blokkot Monaco Editorra vagy CodeMirrorra, \u00e9s k\u00f6sd be JavaScriptb\u0151l a kont\u00e9ner divbe.[1]\n- A \u201eRun\u201d gombot \u00f6sszedr\u00f3tozhatod egy backend API\u2011val (pl. FastAPI, Node), ami Dockerben vagy sandboxban futtatja a k\u00f3dot, \u00e9s a v\u00e1lasz\u00e1t a jobb oldali konzol panelre \u00edrod ki.  \n- Ha szinte 1:1 Replit kin\u00e9zet kell, a fenti v\u00e1ltoz\u00f3kat (sz\u00ednek, kerek\u00edt\u00e9sek, \u00e1rny\u00e9kok) finomhangolhatod az \u00e1ltalad mentett eredeti `index.html`\u2011b\u0151l kim\u00e1solt konkr\u00e9t \u00e9rt\u00e9kekre.[1]","created_at":"2026-01-16T22:50:06.633455Z","label":null,"query_status":"COMPLETED","engine_mode":"reasoning"}]}
